@startuml seq-crosschain
actor Person
participant "Source network" as Source
participant "Circle CCTP" as Circle
participant "Wallet Core" as WC
participant "Destination network" as Dest

Person -> Source : burns USDC (CCTP)
Circle -> Circle : attestation
alt EVM destination
  Circle -> Dest : the Forwarding Service mints
else Stellar destination
  WC -> Circle : asks for the attestation
  WC -> Dest : mint_and_forward to the smart account
end
note over Person
  From Stellar it is the same: the smart account burns
  and Circle mints on the EVM network.
end note
@enduml
